<h3 id=3D"K12TechnologyRoadmap-3.CriticalRiskAssessmentandMitigation">3. Cr=
itical Risk Assessment and Mitigation</h3>
<p>The project faces several <strong>HIGH RISK</strong> areas that could je=
opardize the May 1, 2026 deadline.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d9=
c4f4ba-4158-4bb4-96ec-b327d959ec82" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Critical Risk</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Challenge</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Mitigation Strategy</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>ClassWallet Integration</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>High vendor dependency for all <strong>ESA+ wallet, purchasing, and expe=
nse management</strong> workflows in Phase 4.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Use <strong>Idempotency keys</strong> for all transactions and perform <=
strong>rigorous sandbox testing</strong> early.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Database Schemas</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>High risk due to lack of resources and/or expertise in modernizing legac=
y schemas.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Execute a <strong>Rapid Assessment and Remediation</strong> plan to iden=
tify and address schema issues in parallel with development efforts. Focus =
on <strong>foundational data schemas</strong> first.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Legacy Data Migration</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>High risk due to legacy data quality, volume, and the <strong>current sc=
hema's lack of relational integrity</strong>.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Execute a <strong>Phased Migration by Bounded Context</strong> rather th=
an a single "Big Bang" approach to reduce risk and allow for iterative vali=
dation.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
